From 5d6715fa337dd9173131d9c20aceca3dbc40807d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mcsm <mcsm@localhost>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 18:31:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] embedder (mcsm8): Impeller Vulkan gets a pipeline cache
 directory on the desktop (%LOCALAPPDATA%\<exe>\flutter_vk_cache,
 $XDG_CACHE_HOME or ~/.cache/<exe>/flutter_vk_cache; FLUTTER_VK_CACHE_DIR
 overrides, 0 turns it off), and a frame without a surface of its own (a
 compositor) persists the cache every 50 frames and recycles per-thread
 command pools, as SurfaceContextVK does

---
